          "abstract": "<jats:title>Summary</jats:title><jats:p>This article briefly reviews current literature on techniques for the examination of residuals in linear and nonlinear (including Time Series) models. Concentration is on graphical techniques and statistical test procedures (references involving a \u201croutine\u201d examination, computational aspects and discussion of model adequacy having not been included).</jats:p>",
